# Outfit body (R18): a hoodie, the big hood bunched down the back of the neck, kangaroo pocket standing off the belly
# in the accent, glowing drawstrings hanging over the chest, accent cuff at the hem.
# Torso frame as outfit_vest shifted 2 in x (torso inside x 3..9, y 1..9; pivot 6 5 0 on spine_03).
name outfit_hoodie
grid 5
size 11 10 13
slot cloth SwatchMain
slot pocket SwatchAccent
slot string SwatchGlow
shell 2 0 0 10 10 11 1 cloth
carve box 3 1 0 9 9 10
carve box 4 3 10 8 7 11
ellipsoid 2.6 5 10.6 2.6 3.8 2.3 cloth
carve ellipsoid 3.4 5 11.4 1.4 2.4 1.4
box 10 2 2 11 8 5 pocket
carve box 10 3 3 11 7 4
box 10 3 6 11 4 10 string
box 10 6 6 11 7 10 string
paint box 2 0 0 11 10 1 pocket
pivot 6 5 0
